ion.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1Bh50KnzUOUK4XtT7vzCRTUFPpi.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0hhc211a2glMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Bambai Main Bambu","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2020-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A betrayal against Hasmukh is thwarted. At a party, Jimmy spots their potential next victim. Ahead of his performance, Hasmukh faces an unexpected snag.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xQH9rZQ8ORPgLcMeIt9zlSgsgLv.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0hhc211a2glMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Case Closed","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2020-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The initial Comedy Baadshaho results spark surprise and anger. A sudden death raises suspicions. A meeting with don Jameel Indori inspires Hasmukh.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xQH9rZQ8ORPgLcMeIt9zlSgsgLv.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0hhc211a2glMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Hum Acche Aadmi Nahin Hain","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2020-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As the police question Hasmukh and Jimmy, Promila steps in. KK receives a threat from Indori. Hasmukh makes a potentially disastrous confession.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ePqsI5PM1jQhGeQgL8Cxx5OpEoV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0hhc211a2glMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Machalte Huye Hormones","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2020-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After another death, planted evidence leads the police to Indori. When movie star Rahul Kapoor arrives to judge the show, Hasmukh seizes an opportunity.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nqifgHrELg7dDZBc704Pd012JUU.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0hhc211a2glMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw